---
const coverAsset = '/assets/eBook_Reader_Mockup%201.png';
const productIconAsset = '/assets/section-dot.svg';
---

<section class="product-section" data-node-id="170:11">
  <div class="product-section__content">
    <div class="ebook-cover" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="80">
      <img
        src={coverAsset}
        alt="Capa do e-book Integris Advisor — LGPD na Prática"
        style="display: block; width: 100%; height: auto;"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="product-section__copy" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="160" data-reveal-from="right">
      <p class="product-section__eyebrow">
        <img src={productIconAsset} alt="" width="15" height="15" />
        Produto Digital
      </p>
      <h2>E-book LGPD na Prática:<br /><strong>Governança, Privacidade<br />e Proteção de Dados</strong></h2>
      <p>Aprenda a proteger sua empresa contra multas de até R$ 50 milhões com o guia prático de LGPD e Governança da Integris Advisor.</p>
      <p>Este guia foi desenvolvido para quem precisa de resultados rápidos, segurança jurídica e governança preventiva.</p>
      <a href="#contato" class="product-section__button">Compre agora</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .product-section {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: -50px;
    padding-top: 50px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 0 0 50px 50px;
    background: #d6a73e;
  }

  .product-section__content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(320px, min(38vw, 520px)) minmax(0, 430px);
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: clamp(44px, 5vw, 72px);
    min-height: 640px;
    padding: 50px clamp(32px, 10vw, 144px) 0;
    background: #d6a73e;
  }

  .ebook-cover {
    align-self: end;
    justify-self: center;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 520px;
    transform: translateY(-30px);
  }

  .ebook-cover img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }

  .product-section__copy { align-self: center; max-width: 430px; padding-bottom: 8px; transform: translateY(-35px); }
  .product-section__eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; margin: 0 0 23px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }
  .product-section__eyebrow img { width: 15px; height: 15px; object-fit: contain; }
  .product-section h2 { margin: 0 0 22px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(30px, 2.45vw, 35px); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.14; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .product-section h2 strong { font-weight: 700; }
  .product-section__copy > p:not(.product-section__eyebrow) { max-width: 430px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; }

  .product-section__button {
    display: flex;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 50px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 22px;
    border-radius: 28px;
    color: var(--color-white);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #050505, #303033);
    transition: transform .2s ease, filter .2s ease;
  }

  .product-section__button:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); filter: brightness(1.12); }
  .product-section__button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-white); outline-offset: 4px; }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .product-section { margin-top: -32px; padding-top: 32px; border-radius: 0 0 32px 32px; }
    .product-section__content { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 42px; min-height: 0; padding: 45px 28px 54px; }
    .ebook-cover { width: min(100%, 330px); align-self: auto; transform: none; }
    .product-section__copy { max-width: none; padding-bottom: 0; transform: none; }
  }
</style>
